  "description": {
   "en": "The young Shingen, Harunobu, was shunned by his father, Nobutora, for advising him to take over the reigns of his family. Harunobu, carried along by his vassals who have antipathy toward the unprincipled Nobutora, rebels against him, but...",
   "es": "Los días del joven Shingen, Harunobu, transcurren bajo el desprecio que su padre Nabutora muestra por él. Un padre despótico contra el que tomará la determinación de sublevarse, alentado por las quejas de sus vasallo. ¿Qué acciones tomará Harunobu...?"
  },
